<section class="mb-5" aria-labelledby="architecture-heading">
    <p class="section-kicker">Architecture</p>
    <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4" id="architecture-heading">Design Principles</h2>
    <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 home-pillar-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <img src="https://img.icons8.com/3d-fluency/512/security-checked.png" alt="" class="home-pillar-icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
                    <p class="small fw-bold text-uppercase text-muted mb-2">01</p>
                    <h3 class="h6 fw-bold">Compliance by design</h3>
                    <p class="small mb-0">
                        IFRS, ZIMRA fiscalization, and ISO 27001 requirements are embedded in the platform
                        architecture — not bolted on as afterthoughts. Every transaction, every audit trail,
                        every access control enforces compliance as a byproduct of normal operation.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 home-pillar-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <img src="https://img.icons8.com/3d-fluency/512/database.png" alt="" class="home-pillar-icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
                    <p class="small fw-bold text-uppercase text-muted mb-2">02</p>
                    <h3 class="h6 fw-bold">Single source of truth</h3>
                    <p class="small mb-0">
                        One unified data layer eliminates reconciliation. When inventory moves, the ledger
                        updates. When a sale closes, AR reflects it immediately. Leadership sees current
                        reality, not last month's approximation.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 home-pillar-card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <img src="https://img.icons8.com/3d-fluency/512/cloud.png" alt="" class="home-pillar-icon" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
                    <p class="small fw-bold text-uppercase text-muted mb-2">03</p>
                    <h3 class="h6 fw-bold">Built for African infrastructure</h3>
                    <p class="small mb-0">
                        Offline capability and synchronization are standard. Connectivity constraints
                        are anticipated. Multi-currency environments are native. The platform operates
                        reliably in the conditions where your teams actually work.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

